WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.600
Match each irregular past with its translation. Think of each base verb.

2
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:16.700
had (have) = tuve · saw (see) = vi · bought (buy) = compré · ate (eat) = comí.

3
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:22.300
Bought and brought look alike: bought comes from buy.
